.TH "nvme_init_async_event" 9 "nvme_init_async_event" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_async_event \- Initialize passthru command for Asynchronous Event Request command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_async_event
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Asynchronous Event
Request command. All command specific fields are reserved.
